#. type: Title #
#: ../src/guide/runtime/request.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request"
msgstr "Requisição"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/request.md
msgid "HTTP request has a method, URI, a set of headers and a body:"
msgstr "Uma requisição HTTP tem um método, uma URI, um conjunto de headers e um corpo:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/runtime/request.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"POST /contact HTTP/1.1\n"
"Host: example.org\n"
"Accept-Language: en-us\n"
"Accept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\n"
"\n"
"{\n"
"    \"subject\": \"Hello\",\n"
"    \"body\": \"Hello there, we need to build Yii application together!\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"POST /contact HTTP/1.1\n"
"Host: example.org\n"
"Accept-Language: en-us\n"
"Accept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\n"
"\n"
"{\n"
"    \"subject\": \"Hello\",\n"
"    \"body\": \"Hello there, we need to build Yii application together!\"\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/request.md
msgid "The method is `POST`, URI is `/contact`.  Extra headers are specifying host, preferred language and encoding.  The body could be anything.  In this case, it's a JSON payload."
msgstr "O método é `POST` e a URI é `/contact`.  Os headers extras informam o host, o idioma preferido e a codificação.  O corpo pode ser qualquer coisa.  Neste caso, é um payload JSON."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/request.md
msgid "Yii uses [PSR-7 `ServerRequest`](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-7/) as request representation.  The object is available in controller actions and other types of middleware:"
msgstr "O Yii usa o [`ServerRequest` da PSR-7](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-7/) para representar a requisição.  O objeto está disponível nas actions de controllers e em outros tipos de middleware:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/request.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public function view(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    // ...\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"public function view(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    // ...\n"
"}\n"

